WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:02,800
How

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,670
I really care about whether I have a girlfriend, but I don’t.

3
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:08,600
Zhao Qian, Zhao Qian

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,200
Where has your usual height gone?

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,120
Why can't I resist when she touches her?

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,640
But her arms

7
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,240
It feels really safe

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,020
I'll take a taxi back to school first

9
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,660
You have to go on a long journey tomorrow

10
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,060
Go back and rest early

11
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,140
Why don't you go back to school?

12
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,500
You can't go to Sky Blue No. 1 tonight and stay with me. You can't.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,330
The goddess of Boeing who was once the most powerful person in the school

14
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,930
Now she is my full-time secretary

15
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,650
The feeling of being rich and powerful

16
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:37,690
wonderful indeed

17
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:40,250
But I can't do any of the serious things that need to be done.

18
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,290
Back to Xiaoshui Village

19
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,680
Go, go, despair, let’s go

20
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:52,180
I packed big-bone pork ribs rice for you and followed it with my palm

21
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,260
I heard you were in town
